  <subsection|Bounded transition and scalar-selection refresh \V 2026-11-12
  05:44 UTC><label|bounded-transition-and-scalar-selection-refresh--2026-11-12-0544-utc>

  The source of <verbatim|YM.Stationary.transition_cap>
