  found no existing canonical manuscript proof of the general result.
  Local-sections separates off-shell radial connection jets by plaquette
  samplers; trace-free-rank treats particular low-grade sectors. Neither
  establishes strict reflected positivity for the simultaneous constrained
  free jet tower.

  The missing core is <verbatim|YM.Extra.FD.shiftAll_gram/towerB_pos> in
  FREE_DETECTOR_ALGEBRA/PositiveLeg.lean. Translation/Kelvin dual-probe
  shifts triangularize all jet orders together, giving positive pivots (-1)^j
  strength(j)\|x\|^(-2(j+2)). Its analytic precursor is LegAct.reply_radial,
  then Shift.signal_kelvin/signal_lower/signal_top; this uses the actual
  on-shell Maxwell/Bianchi tensor space and all-order massless Green
  derivative identity. Separate positivity of each same-order block would not
  suffice. The finite polynomial extension is Script.from_large -\<gtr\>
  Duplex.aligned_step -\<gtr\> PowerGram.aligned_script/duplex_script
  -\<gtr\> WickPositive.reflected_positive, with diagonal norm sum
  \|c_alpha\|^2 times product(alpha_i! d_i^alpha_i).
  Rank.point_probe/no_residual then uses one reflected-conjugate polynomial
  spectator at a separated pair, and Columns.faceTest_eq/scanner_inj follows
  by basis expansion. This cluster has no interacting paid-history premise;
  its genuine analytic boundary is the Green/Kelvin and constrained-jet
  identity. Parent was sent this exact source map; no duplicate proof was
  authored here.

