  separate owner-energy input is <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Milk.Hefts>
  and <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Milk.launched>
  (Opacity/Hulls): actual packet O,A,D with D\<gtr\>=205 radiusB,
