  times the levy sum over ceilingE at radius200B. It uses actual Wax.Peaking
  plus Seen and the same harvested charts. Canonical seed-energy,
  warning-safety, annulus same-data and stationary exterior proofs are the
  correct reuse candidates. The exact harvested charge and threshold match
