  These are the sharp analytic gates to the corrected-Plate join.

  <strong|3. Body reconstruction is a short actual identity join, not another
  expansion theorem.> <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.Pump.Vale.land>
  in Opacity/Gardener proves BodyGrant from this same Draft/Plate. Its
  prerequisites are bp.threshold=temp(y), W\<gtr\>0, fiery(y)\<gtr\>0, fine
  threshold\<gtr\>=fiery(y)/2, Certified, literal up=source.path and
  high=source.clip, LocalRatio and beta\<gtr\>0. Its finite identities
  births/cropping/backyard/rect recover the actual flags, supports and
  connected-component partition; cardinal_spin and pursues then align the
  scalar loading, Haar/dummy factors, Gaussian exponential, likelihood/noise
  and genuine source exponent. Canonical gaussian-reassembly and
  allarity-planted provide the arguments, but the same explicit loading
  identity must be shown for the corrected Plate. <verbatim|Soft.husks>
  (Shipment) provides Voyage for white(P) on that corrected alphabet: it uses
  actual label Moves, forest/tag transport and the independent
  signed/conjugation action; nominal invariance alone is insufficient.

  <strong|4. Normalize once, before arbitrary marked labels, and retain both
  uses.> <verbatim|Soft.Bonfire.lifted> applies Kraft to the same tabloid of
  the actual restarted rung. <verbatim|Soft.Bonfire.fury> selects coarse Q
  with Q.beta=P.beta, the actual path/clip/budget, and scalar loading
  exp(c\|Site\|-beta*basis). It then uses <verbatim|Soft.Funds.pyro_gen>:
  masked log terms plus path corrections have cost boxesCost+16sigma and
  exactly reconstruct the new exponent. This is already the algebra proved in
