  consumes Veins(white P), BodyGrant(P), Lease and Resin(white P), and
  outputs one Kiln: Holdings plus, for every finite marked site family,
  Reparations and ReturnTrip for white P. ReturnTrip (Display/Revival) has
  both Intervals and forced embedding; its constructor here uses
  v_carves/v_in_boxes and repair_lower. Canonical all-hole/forced-exclusion
  arguments must be applied to the same corrected alphabet and scalar
  normalizer, not inferred from equality of archived activities alone.
  <verbatim|Soft.Unlid.arousing> calls stove twice with the same compiler and
  Q, only decreasing multipliers/exponents; this is exactly the upper/lower
  reuse already priced in actual-mixed-marked-compiler.

  Recommended next scope: one compact actual corrected-Plate/body/all-hole
  join, with an explicit value-price table and exact loading identity,
  reusing all canonical combinatorics and estimates. Keep Hefts/Seen/Peaking
  and all-Matched Pupil gates visibly separate until their actual source
  functions are matched to the ongoing annulus/guard work. This audit does
  not certify those analytic inputs or global all-arity closure.

  <subsection|Small-window producer: exact repair
  boundary><label|small-window-producer-exact-repair-boundary>

  Lattice snapshot 6dd3a8d8 is not an analytic closure: Translate only
  bijects panel labels. The minimal remaining proof is the finite source
  specialization <verbatim|Movers.stamps/local_gram -\<gtr\>
  ChipHeal.adjust/switches/chip_repair> and <verbatim|TurnZero.rowzero
  -\<gtr\> Subtotal.accounting/spacing/focused>, followed by
  <verbatim|Cues.pay_mean> and <verbatim|NearDelay.fares>. It keeps the
  actual and flat precisions distinct and uses both floors. If w=A(1+till)t,
  the local Gram error is D[(A+w)w+wA], D=pieces*grain(span). A panel of at
  most n slots gives n^2 eta^-1 error E^-1 by the inverse identity. The mean
  error is N D M A t widen + M E exp(-s B) X t, from the exact
  ordered-inverse residual identity. At t=R clearanceFare, clearanceFare is
  an explicit degree-five B polynomial times temp; fixed R is absorbed before
  the period. Subpower multipliers and temp\<less\>=x^(-1/2+1/32) give the
  mean x^(-7/8); the column price uses temp\<less\>=x^(-1/2+1/8) and
  multiplier\<less\>=x^(1/8), giving x^(-1/4). The panel radius is natural
  floor((B+80)/20); none of these formulas replaces the outer B. Canonical
  local-mean/covariance/jet proofs supply the analytic mechanisms, but their
  literal stencil/source matching must appear in the repair.

  Dawn selection then needs the seed-free store with actual retimed flags, as
  in Emulation.nohole/expose, or a separate clearMargin assumption for
  arbitrary stores. Coarse health does not eliminate arbitrary seed sets. Its
  threshold and room arithmetic is otherwise checked; guard and short-cover
  sources remain separate assigned inputs.

  <section|Current interacting-rank / equation-kernel frontier (bounded
  refresh)><label|current-interacting-rank--equation-kernel-frontier-bounded-refresh>

  This supersedes the old free-detector, general inverse, harvested-energy
  and corrected-body gaps above. Source pin is unchanged. Reviewed current
  canonical interfaces and immediate <verbatim|Soft/{Star,Diana,Supra}>,
  <verbatim|MergeProof/{Powder,Eureka,Chaletbin,Canopy,Portions,Snow}> calls;
  no whole-tree traversal. The conclusions below distinguish a genuinely
  unfinished estimate from an application that still needs exact
  quantifier/data binding.

  <\enumerate>
    <item><strong|Actual posed local reader, currently in repair.> The
    missing quantitative producer is <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.LocalGaussianLaws.Lift.accounting/focused>
    and the <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.LocalGaussianLaws.Remote> ChipHeal
    comparison specialization at the small panels, as detailed above. The
    full static tree identity and cut/full covariance sandwich are now
    canonical. Next comes <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.InteractingRank.pointing>,
    <verbatim|slide_link>, <verbatim|laminate> and <verbatim|throughout> and
    the actual Curved.Stencil veil loss, in
    <verbatim|PhysicalNext/AFTERNOON_INTERACTING_RANK_COMPARISON/{CoreBudget,Illumined,Rail}.lean>
    and <verbatim|PHYSICAL_GUARD_7F546/Continuation/Stencil.lean>. Guard
    draft b12 is held for bond/plaquette, forecast-array, phase and
    actual-mask repairs, not merely notation. The remaining short-cover
    application must identify the same posed field and global parent reader.
    Output needed: the actual joint Gaussian, mean/covariance errors,
    nonzero-guard healthy/read estimate and guard loss, uniformly over
    forest/tag/period on the same seed-free store. Parent Dawn selection
    already proves the uniform threshold and same-tube assembly conditional
    on those outputs. No new general inverse or density theorem is warranted.

    <item><strong|All-Matched warning gate remains distinct.> The corrected
    unmarked alphabet and genuine loading now pass in
    actual-corrected-body-compiler; actual-harvested-owner-energy closes
    Milk.Hefts at its exact retained seed/chart/branch hypotheses. Still bind
    <verbatim|Pump.Granite/excels -\<gtr\> Pump.ballot>
    (<verbatim|Opacity/Mezzanine.lean>) to the literal <verbatim|Pupil> in
    <verbatim|Opacity/Acreage.lean>: every Matched palette has the specified
    Pours price and the exact Toned implication kills its sock. Rail's posed
    seed-free reader is not this quantifier domain. Canonical warning safety,
    Gaussian warning moments and packet reassembly are the reuse, with exact
    socket/scale/support specialization. Output then feeds Gush.foreshadows
    and Soft.French.accepts_stock on the same corrected alphabet; white(P)
    and genuine P cannot be interchanged.

    <item><strong|Public frequent purchases: finite same-data binding remains
    after items 1\U2.> Exact consumer is <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.Accent.rated>
    in <verbatim|MergeProof/Powder.lean>. Its input <verbatim|hr> is, for
    each grade d, frequently k with Tender, Metering at -3, and the same
    ShowHours/Vents. <verbatim|YM.PhysicalNext.Repeat.Legato.capitalSnow/franchise>
    (<verbatim|MergeProof/Snow.lean>) constructs that input from
    PreStand/Shops, the selected L lower bounds, eventual grade membership
    and one enlarged Paid wait; castle preserves the actual Binding world and
    K prices. Verify this on the same public run rather than a separately
    chosen restart. Canonical common-scale-selection/common-funded-history,
    restarted-rank-history, Dawn, coordinate calibration, actual covariance
    Fourier/transport, healthy cumulants, marked propagation, mixed compiler
    and rank-root normalization supply the component mechanisms. The
    still-useful join is their exact outputs into
    <verbatim|Soft.Star.rented/backstage/cast_off -\<gtr\>
    Diana.v_paid_factory -\<gtr\> Supra.v_culminates/v_pay_all/v_obtain_purchases>.
    Its output is one Trials and Market.Purchases on the actual same family,
    including all stated coefficient/cost quantifiers. Do not replace this
    join by a new broad analytic comparison chapter. In particular, for this
    rank consumer FD.vane has extra+1\<less\>=2, and Star explicitly uses
    Choir only for n\<less\>=2. A new arbitrary-arity reader estimate is
    unnecessary for this particular endpoint.

    <item><strong|Finite equation identification is an all-spectator
    calibration comparison, not missing linear algebra.>
    <verbatim|YM.MergeProof.reception> in Eureka.lean constructs Scotia from
    Makes, Stock.Tabs, Scrim, Fridge, sound portfolio and Braze. The
    indispensable quantitative map is <verbatim|Canopy.solaris> with its
    single near-identity P and uniform inverse coeffSize\<less\>=2, and
    matter bound with slow E, for all opened lower levels and motions. Its
    immediate suppliers are inviting plus figment, using the same
    original-history portfolio. The current
    actual-marked-portfolio-calibration and
    original-history-portfolio-attachment provide the finite coupon/census
    estimates and witness identity; any still-retained uniform
    clocksHere/climbing/height/Cream hypotheses must be matched to this one
    P, not inferred from the names of records. <verbatim|Chaletbin.marshal>
    then uses this P to inverse-calibrate every subpower kernel row,
    <verbatim|Mark.skyprobes> for exact separated spectator vanishing of the
    equation carrier, and <verbatim|embark> for its centered difference
    tending to zero. <verbatim|Portions.thyme/lofty> additionally give the
    insertion/derivative vet costs through persists and served_dollar on the
    same Fridge/Scrim. Output needed is Scotia.relay on every subsequent
    mesh/period refinement. Canonical marked-campaign, portfolio calibration,
    centered service and fullmesh Cauchy are the reuse. No new free
    positivity or generic projection proof is needed.

    <item><strong|Endpoint algebra is already available, conditional on
    3\U4.> finite-rank-kernel-transport proves simultaneous projection
    extraction, exact all-test silent-kernel use, rank inequalities and the
    nonorthogonal conjugator; all-grade-free-detectors supplies general free
