    <verbatim|embrace/quakes -\<gtr\> dine -\<gtr\>
    Maker.nearby/precise/layout_hyp> route. New marked portfolio/terminal
    service and fullmesh-correlation chapters likely discharge substantial
    ingredients; an exact same-law, same-normalization match with the finite
    supremum prepared observable must still be shown. The finite product
    estimate itself is already proved. Do not count a complex-valued
    approximant or a mere single fixed pair bound as the simultaneous
    real-copy input.

    <item><strong|All-power corrected-detector moments.>
    <verbatim|Bid.Fetch.episode> uses Work B15--B18 to get Retain.Funds.
    Phase-fields proves Funds -\<gtr\> every-character bound -\<gtr\> no new
    phase-null labels, while finite-rank-kernel-transport concerns the
    unselected quotient and is not this step. The missing small join encodes
    the actual one- and two-point corrected polynomials as Episodes: unary
    minus constant; binary minus two unary terms plus the prescribed
    constant. B18 uses exactly the same lift/later labels and Valid.cheap
    root bounds. Then planted copies (B15), ordered finite-volume limits
    (B16), and separated-cluster limits (B17) give every power of the entire
    corrected compressed operator, not just its pair moments. Reuse corrected
    rank trials, centered/planted inequalities, finite polynomial algebra and
    phase-fields. No new free rank proof is needed.
  </enumerate>

  These are distinct from the still-active guard/Pupil and physical-annulus
  suppliers, and the external trace sensor/branch packages. The old
  assembly.tex joint-input assumption and historical phase-evidence lists
  should be rewritten only after these exact joins are proved or explicitly
  matched. The audit found no need to redo the already written complex heat,
  tube boundary, locality, spectral-measure or Lorentz cross-grade ODE
  arguments. Their actual representation and same hierarchy inputs remain the
  gate above.

